This is a placeholder for the 192x192 app icon. You'll need to replace this with an actual PNG image.

To create proper app icons:
1. Design a 512x512 icon with your RoxPT logo (flame + "RoxPT" text)
2. Use a tool like https://realfavicongenerator.net/ or https://www.pwabuilder.com/imageGenerator
3. Generate all required sizes (192x192, 512x512, etc.)
4. Replace these placeholder files

Recommended design:
- Background: Black (#000000)
- Primary: Yellow (#FFCC00)
- Icon: Flame symbol
- Text: "RoxPT" or just flame icon
- Ensure good contrast for visibility

